                  ],
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", it’s important to note that the iterator processes entities one at a time. This sequential approach can lead to longer processing times or potential performance issues, especially when a large number of entities are subjected to scalar filtering.",
