                "content": "d \\rightarrow E_d = [e_{d1}, e_{d2}, \\dots, e_{dn}] ∈ \\R^{n×d}\n",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ". When a query arrives, it is also tokenized, vectorized, and stored as an embedding list, as in ",
